    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n59869" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρήμν-ημι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρεμάννυμι</span>
